:0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 with Max-Q Design (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.3892) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1065G7 CPU @ 1.30GHz (8 threads) - 31.59 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nMove or copy and paste keys in the Bezier Curve Editor, the Handle Mode changes to “Free.”  And \"undo\" will not revert this handle mode.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open MRP node_2d.tscn.\n2. Open Animation dock and select new_animation.\n3. Check Handle Mode of key is \"Linear\".\n4. Drag animation key to move.\n5. Handle Mode of key has changed to \"Free\".\n\n\nbefore\n<img width=\"256\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a04e8c0-5f48-49a2-b619-1836ac41e85c\" />\n\nafter\n<img width=\"256\"  alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2cd058c8-9121-4158-b831-8c97a336c466\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp-bezier-key-lost-handle-mode.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31255653/mrp-bezier-key-lost-handle-mode.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.githu